{"name":"-44-A2-4First","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreen","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"222","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Brain","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Inside the warehouse, the black-clad Nyto who has just met with the smuggler is walking down an aisle. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"On both sides, white soldiers are loading crates of formulations onto conveyor belts in an orderly fashion. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The Nyto passes through the files of soldiers and arrive before a Nyto in white at the end of the aisle."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoWhite","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"White Nyto","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Well?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoWhite","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"Nyto","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Nyto","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That man has outlived his usefulness."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoWhite","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"Nyto","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"White Nyto","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"And the replacement?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoWhite","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"Nyto","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Nyto","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Doctor will send him over soon."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoWhite","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"Nyto","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"White Nyto","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The next batch is to be delivered to Narciss. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Handl